dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_001.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_004.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_005.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_011.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_013.severity = suggestion


; REACTOR_MOD_003 debt, scoped to the 9 files that still carry it. Deliberately a file
; list and not a `**/*.cs` glob, matching the REACTOR_HOOKS_* treatment above: this is a
; correctness rule, so a silent modifier drop in any other sample — or in a new one — must
; still break the build. Delete a path once its file is clean; delete the whole section once
; the list is empty.
;
; Every path below is now owned by #950 alone (see the triage above): all 19 remaining hits
; are a reconciler/DSL gate gap that will clear WITHOUT editing any sample. It is scheduled
; work, not a standing exemption.
;
; Pruned four times. PR #941 rewrote CanvasPage.cs's Rectangle().Background(...) calls to
; .Fill(...), and ParallaxViewPage.cs came clean with it. Then #961 fixed the 5 genuine
; sample bugs and four more files went clean with them: command-palette-window/Program.cs,
; ReactorCharting.Gallery/Samples/WeeklyForecast.cs, GridViewPage.cs and SpacingPage.cs.
; Note GridViewPage.cs — an earlier revision of this comment claimed it was "still dirty for
; unrelated hits"; it was not. Then the #950 branch widened the Padding gate to TextBlock,
; clearing 58 hits and taking this list from 32 paths to 14: ChatTimeline.cs, LandingPage.cs,
; DataGridDemo.cs, IntegratedDataDemo.cs, SpecializedEditorsDemo.cs, ReactorCharting.Gallery/
; Program.cs, MultiLineChart.cs, RefreshContainerPage.cs, SemanticZoomPage.cs, FlyoutPage.cs,
; BorderPage.cs, GridPage.cs, RelativePanelPage.cs, ScrollViewPage.cs, NavigationViewPage.cs,
; PivotPage.cs, TabViewPage.cs and AcrylicPage.cs all went clean. Re-run the sweep after any
; sample fix and drop whatever has gone clean, and measure rather than trusting a note. This
; branch widened the Grid/StackPanel/RelativePanel gates, clearing 7 hits and removing
; StatusPanel.cs, ValueList.cs, CommandingDemo/App.cs, TransitionsDemo.cs and
; StylingGallery/App.cs.
[{apps/animated-list-demo/App.cs,apps/chat/Chat.UI/InputBar.cs,apps/chat/Chat.UI/Sidebar.cs,apps/demo-script-tool/App/Components/StepCard.cs,apps/demo-script-tool/App/DemoScriptShell.cs,apps/headtrax/HeadTrax/Components/EmployeeGrid.cs,apps/monaco-editor/App.cs,apps/widget-creator/WidgetCreatorShell.cs,TodoApp/Program.cs}]
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_MOD_003.severity = suggestion
